claimed: okay-script-cache -- operator ask 2026-09-07: response caching for pages. STATIC files get conditional requests unconditionally: a strong ETag from (size, mtime), Last-Modified, and 304 for If-None-Match / If-Modified-Since. PAGES opt in with front-matter `cache: <seconds>` (or `cache: none`): the rendered body's ETag (sha-256, base64url, weak-free), Cache-Control public/max-age when the response is safe to share and private when it is not -- a page that is `secure:`, that set a cookie, or whose session was touched is PRIVATE, never public, and a page that redirected or answered >= 400 is not cached at all. 304 answers carry the validators and no body. Only GET/HEAD. Touches Site.scala (+ a small Caching helper), specs/okay-script.md, docs; tests through Site.handle.
